      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "November means fall is in full swing, and Netflix has a ton of new titles to celebrate. Whether you’re looking to watch family-friendly films over Thanksgiving or are still looking to be spooked post-spooky season, there is something, new or old, for everyone.",
      "links": [
        {
          "text": "Netflix",
          "url": "https://variety.com/t/netflix/"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "One highly anticipated film joining the streamer this month is “The Mosquito Bowl” starring Nicholas Galitzine, Bill Skarsgård, Peter Berg and more. The film follows four college football stars in the aftermath of Pearl Harbor as they enlist in the US Marines, discovering the strength of brotherhood and the cost of war."
    },
